# Dethrone (CR 702.105a) in a game of three: Bot1 has 10 life, Bot2 15 and Bot3 20. On turn 4 Bot1 attacks Bot3 with Grenzo's Cutthroat - Bot3 has the
# most life, so it gets a +1/+1 counter - and Bot2 with Enraged Revolutionary - Bot2 has more than the attacker's controller but less than Bot3, so it
# gets nothing. The trigger compares every player in the game, not just the one attacked and the one attacking.

